    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1461">

                <pb facs="1234" n="1130" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1130"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 702.9319/8.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Chargé d’Affaires.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-11-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 12, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Chinese Minister for Foreign Affairs desires following communicated Government
                    Panama: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Minister for Foreign Affairs requests recall of order revoking exequatur
                            of Chinese Consul General Panama; at same time he will depute an
                            official to replace Consul General Ou Yang.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
